  "scope": "Declared native relay-cycle QoS ownership, authenticated HTTP/component fixtures and numerical regressions; no new unchanged-original execution, actual engine/world or delivered activation proof.",
  "reproduced_gap": {
    "trigger": "An admitted guest starts a real physical route probe, then queries pending with the same logical guest pair.",
    "before": "Python allocation succeeds under physical owner IDs, but pending returns false under guest IDs.",
    "after": "Rust allocation, pending, measurements and views share one native physical pair. Three complete actual socket cycles yield the same 50ms median for root/guest/reversed reads.",
    "red_report": "search-qos-canonical-red-report.json",
    "red_log": "search-qos-canonical-red-step-1.log"
  },
  "rust_authorities": "Rust now owns authenticated native relay QoS: physical pair canonicalization; session/socket generations and retirement; strict control/heartbeat validation; two dispatched challenge legs, timestamps, three-sample medians and leases; per-endpoint atomic reservations, bounded retry/row/probe/queue banks and generation-tagged immediate IO wakeups. The actual guest pending-key mismatch is reproduced and corrected through authenticated sockets. Python retains typed socket/clock IO and read-only projections. These are declared modern relay-cycle policies, not recovered Xbox XNet/service producers. Full service/endpoint replacement, accepted social/party/clan CRUD, readers, cross-store recovery and original/native played/delivered gates remain open.",
  "checks": [
    "Native session/private authorization/socket generation guards, two-upgrade publication race, revocation and stale reader/retirement exclusion",
    "Canonical guest/root/reversed pairs through authenticated queue/socket admission and three actual relay cycles",
    "Two independent unpredictable challenges per cycle, no undispatched-leg completion, exact nonce/actor binding and replay refusal",
    "Three-sample integer median, fixed collection deadline, measurement expiry and nonregressing clock",
    "One-use generation-tagged wake destinations and immediate writer events; heartbeat IO completes before a route timestamp",
    "Atomic two-endpoint reservation/refill, idempotent requests and actual bounded partial-work retry",
    "Combined50000-row bank includes partial collectors,1000-probe/4-per-endpoint/8-queue bounds and128-key metadata pages",
    "Declared internal synthetic capacity fixture is separate from actual authenticated HTTP and original numerical controls",
    "Strict Rust search JSON/field validation, heartbeat cadence/expiry/control budget; a late pong cannot renew a peer",
    "Read-only Python views and no production restore/install/measurement-set operation",
    "Full backend queue/gathering/loading/continuity/voice/result/transaction/PCR/requeue regressions and default production ABI"
  ],
